{
 "name": "HL · Listening post · collect",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## HL · Listening post: collect (Lesson 5.3)\nEvery 15 minutes: Facebook Page comments, Instagram comments and Talkwalker Alerts web mentions, merged into one shape (source, item_id, link, posted_at, text) and passed to SUB · Listening post: label and alert, which removes duplicates.\n\nCredentials:\n- Facebook Graph API (Page access token) on Facebook Page comments.\n- Header Auth \"Meta page token\" (Name Authorization, Value Bearer + Page access token) on both Instagram nodes. Instagram needs a Business or Creator account.\nPlaceholders: YOUR_PAGE_ID, YOUR_IG_USER_ID, YOUR_TALKWALKER_RSS_URL, YOUR_LABEL_WORKFLOW_ID.\nAttach your error workflow (3.6).",
    "height": 400,
    "width": 500
   },
   "id": "616ba823-8ace-48ee-aa27-4d7a012ad827",
   "name": "Note 1",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    -560,
    -380
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "rule": {
     "interval": [
      {
       "field": "minutes",
       "minutesInterval": 15
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   "id": "164750b8-9735-4ed1-ae7c-4519ae7d3db9",
   "name": "Every 15 minutes",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
   "typeVersion": 1.2,
   "position": [
    0,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "httpRequestMethod": "GET",
    "node": "YOUR_PAGE_ID",
    "edge": "posts",
    "options": {
     "fields": {
      "field": [
       {
        "name": "id"
       },
       {
        "name": "permalink_url"
       },
       {
        "name": "comments.limit(50){id,message,created_time,permalink_url}"
       }
      ]
     },
     "queryParameters": {
      "parameter": [
       {
        "name": "limit",
        "value": "10"
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   },
   "id": "6745c37c-b8fe-44da-ae4d-aa57eb1474be",
   "name": "Facebook Page comments",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.facebookGraphApi",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    220,
    -180
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "jsCode": "const out = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  for (const post of (item.json.data || [item.json])) {\n    for (const c of (post.comments?.data || [])) {\n      out.push({ json: { source: 'facebook', item_id: c.id, link: c.permalink_url || post.permalink_url,\n        posted_at: c.created_time, text: c.message || '' } });\n    }\n  }\n}\nreturn out;\n",
    "mode": "runOnceForAllItems"
   },
   "id": "001efc9d-2e4b-4d66-9a1e-56ab40aa3ef2",
   "name": "Normalise Facebook",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
   "typeVersion": 2,
   "position": [
    440,
    -180
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "method": "GET",
    "url": "https://graph.facebook.com/v21.0/YOUR_IG_USER_ID/media",
    "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
    "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
    "sendQuery": true,
    "queryParameters": {
     "parameters": [
      {
       "name": "fields",
       "value": "id,permalink,timestamp"
      },
      {
       "name": "limit",
       "value": "10"
      }
     ]
    },
    "options": {}
   },
   "id": "3aae4408-98bb-4cfc-9b2d-447744d7fa29",
   "name": "Instagram recent media",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
   "typeVersion": 4.2,
   "position": [
    220,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "fieldToSplitOut": "data",
    "options": {}
   },
   "id": "6974a792-5be2-4a65-b8ea-cffa6fc8e0df",
   "name": "One item per media",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    440,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "method": "GET",
    "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/v21.0/{{ $json.id }}/comments",
    "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
    "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
    "sendQuery": true,
    "queryParameters": {
     "parameters": [
      {
       "name": "fields",
       "value": "id,text,timestamp"
      }
     ]
    },
    "options": {}
   },
   "id": "935b7fb4-e87e-4ee8-a2a7-11a7ca06ba6b",
   "name": "Instagram comments",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
   "typeVersion": 4.2,
   "position": [
    660,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "jsCode": "const out = [];\nconst media = $('One item per media').all();\n$input.all().forEach((item, i) => {\n  const permalink = media[i]?.json.permalink || '';\n  for (const c of (item.json.data || [])) {\n    out.push({ json: { source: 'instagram', item_id: c.id, link: permalink, posted_at: c.timestamp, text: c.text || '' } });\n  }\n});\nreturn out;\n",
    "mode": "runOnceForAllItems"
   },
   "id": "6ca52a70-9ed0-4f84-83ca-bf79a2b08adc",
   "name": "Normalise Instagram",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
   "typeVersion": 2,
   "position": [
    880,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "method": "GET",
    "url": "YOUR_TALKWALKER_RSS_URL",
    "options": {
     "response": {
      "response": {
       "responseFormat": "text"
      }
     }
    }
   },
   "id": "872dc74c-5b55-45c7-928f-e73bc6db797b",
   "name": "Talkwalker Alerts RSS",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
   "typeVersion": 4.2,
   "position": [
    220,
    180
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "jsCode": "// Stands in for n8n's RSS Read node: parse the feed's items.\nconst xml = String($input.first().json.data || '');\nconst pick = (block, tag) => {\n  const m = block.match(new RegExp('<' + tag + '[^>]*>([\\\\s\\\\S]*?)</' + tag + '>', 'i'));\n  return m ? m[1].replace(/<!\\[CDATA\\[|\\]\\]>/g, '').replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ').trim() : '';\n};\nconst items = xml.split(/<item[\\s>]/i).slice(1);\nreturn items.map(b => {\n  const link = pick(b, 'link');\n  return { json: { source: 'web', item_id: pick(b, 'guid') || link, link, posted_at: pick(b, 'pubDate'),\n    text: (pick(b, 'title') + ' - ' + pick(b, 'description')).slice(0, 1000) } };\n});\n",
    "mode": "runOnceForAllItems"
   },
   "id": "209436d0-12b1-45f1-9355-94998d480abf",
   "name": "Normalise web",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
   "typeVersion": 2,
   "position": [
    440,
